# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#           API TESTING TEMPLATE - Backend Development
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file to your project root
#   2. Press <leader>re to select environment (dev/staging/prod)
#   3. Place cursor on any request and press <leader>rr to execute
#   4. Press <leader>rv to toggle response view
#   5. Press <leader>rc to copy request as cURL
#
# Variables:
#   - Use {{variable}} syntax for environment variables
#   - Define variables in http-envs/*.json files
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Environment variables (defined in http-envs/dev.json)
@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@apiUrl = {{apiUrl}}
@token = {{token}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HEALTH CHECK
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness check
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
Accept: application/json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AUTHENTICATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Login
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get current user
GET {{apiUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Refresh token
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# USERS API (CRUD Operations)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all users
GET {{apiUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get user by ID
GET {{apiUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create new user
POST {{apiUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "role": "user"
}

### Update user
PUT {{apiUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Partial update user
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PAGINATION & FILTERING
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get users with pagination
GET {{apiUrl}}/users?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get users with filtering
GET {{apiUrl}}/users?role=admin&status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get users with sorting
GET {{apiUrl}}/users?sort=name,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FILE UPLOAD
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Upload file
POST {{apiUrl}}/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./example.txt
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SPRING BOOT ACTUATOR (if using Spring Boot)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Actuator health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Actuator metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json

### Actuator info
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### Actuator environment
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/env
Accept: application/json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ERROR HANDLING TESTS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Test 400 Bad Request
POST {{apiUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invalid": "data"
}

### Test 401 Unauthorized
GET {{apiUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json

### Test 404 Not Found
GET {{apiUrl}}/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CUSTOM HEADERS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Request with custom headers
GET {{apiUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Request-ID: {{$guid}}
X-Client-Version: 1.0.0
X-Custom-Header: custom-value

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NOTES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Keybindings:
#   <leader>rr - Run current request
#   <leader>ra - Run all requests
#   <leader>rn - Next request
#   <leader>rp - Previous request
#   <leader>rv - Toggle view (body/headers/both)
#   <leader>ri - Inspect request details
#   <leader>rc - Copy as cURL command
#   <leader>re - Select environment
#   <leader>rt - Open scratchpad
#
# Dynamic variables (Kulala built-in):
#   {{$guid}}          - Generate a GUID
#   {{$randomInt}}     - Random integer
#   {{$timestamp}}     - Current timestamp
#   {{$datetime}}      - Current datetime
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
